      "@type": "cat-harness:Tool",
      "description": "Read the IG Publisher's `expansions.json` and `txcache/`, as `ig-cache.sh restore` leaves them, and write `index.json` (gzipped as `index.json.gz` over 1 MB): every code with its system and display, and each value set's codes. The IG site's service worker answers the self-hosted Form Builder's LOINC search from it, and its UCUM search from the vendored full UCUM list, so the site makes no cross-site call (owner, 2026-10-14: \"cache + ucum. this is gh-pages so no XSS\"). `build-ig-site` runs it for every IG with a Questionnaire.",
      "install": {
        "none": true
      },
      "invoke": {
        "shell": "bun run fhir-harness/scripts/terminology-index.ts --expansions <expansions> --txcache <txcache> --out <out>"
      },
